            <ArticleTitle>Very late stent thrombosis: simultaneous two-arterial occlusions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>281-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.carrev.2007.08.007</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a patient with an unusual case of very late dual Cypher stent thrombosis that caused massive acute myocardial infarction and cardiogenic shock, which were treated using emergent resuscitation and angioplasty.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
